<title>GREECE: ATHENS BOURSE OKS DELTA INFORM RIGHTS ISSUE.</title>
<headline>ATHENS BOURSE OKS DELTA INFORM RIGHTS ISSUE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delta Informatics got Athens stock exchange approval for a 1.5 billion drachma rights issue.</p>
<p>Delta Informatics will issue 500,000 new common registered shares with a par value of 300 drachmas at 3,000 drachmas each. The terms will be one new share per nine held.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
